<h1>Action Required <span class="accent-danger">&#9888;</span></h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your recent payment requires additional authentication to complete.
  This is a security step required by your bank (3D Secure verification).
</p>

<p>
  Please click the button below to complete the verification. If you don't
  complete this step, your payment will not be processed and your subscription
  may be interrupted.
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;">
  <%= link_to "Complete Payment", @hosted_invoice_url, class: "button" %>
</p>

<hr class="divider">

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #a8aaaf;">
  This link will take you to a secure Stripe-hosted page to verify your payment.
  If you didn't initiate this payment, please contact us at
  <a href="mailto:support@thin.ly" style="color: #a8aaaf;">support@thin.ly</a>.
</p>
